#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/bbox_display.rst:4
msgid "边界框显示"
msgstr "bounding box display"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/bbox_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/bbox_display.rst:9
msgid ""
"边界框显示节点用于在图像中检测到的对象周围绘制矩形框，是最常用的可视化方式之一。该节点支持多种颜色方案、自定义样式和灵活的配置选项，可以清晰地展示目标检测、实例分割等模型的预测结果。"
msgstr ""
"The bounding box display node is used to draw rectangular boxes around "
"detected objects in the image and is one of the most commonly used "
"visualization methods.This node supports multiple color schemes, custom "
"styles, and flexible configuration options, and can clearly display the "
"prediction results of models such as target detection and instance "
"segmentation."

